tools.apply_patch.description:
Change multiple files in one patch, suited to small **short-line, regularly formatted** hunks and Add/Delete. Format (no line numbers, located by context lines):
*** Begin Patch
*** Update File: css/style.css
@@
 .hero {
-  color: red;
+  color: #1677ff;
 }
*** Add File: css/theme.css
+:root { --brand: #1677ff; }
*** Delete File: css/old.css
*** End Patch
Each hunk must include at least one context line (starting with a space), unique in the file. For long lines or files where patches have failed, use capture_range/matchId + apply_string_edits.

